        "start": 596.0799999999999,
        "end": 597.0799999999999,
        "english": "Exactly.",
        "chinese": "正确翻译为中文是：“正好。”"
    },
    {
        "start": 597.08,
        "end": 598.88,
        "english": "Okay, great words and great dialogues.",
        "chinese": "好的，好词和好对话。"
    },
    {
        "start": 598.88,
        "end": 600.4000000000001,
        "english": "Yeah, I love this dialogue.",
        "chinese": "是的，我喜欢这段对话。"
    },
    {
        "start": 600.4000000000001,
        "end": 601.88,
        "english": "Yeah, it's kind of funny.",
        "chinese": "是的，它有点奇怪。"
    },
    {
        "start": 601.88,
        "end": 605.0400000000001,
        "english": "So we could listen to it again, and then we'll come back and talk a little bit about",
        "chinese": "所以我们可以再次听取它，然后我们再聊点小的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 605.0400000000001,
        "end": 606.0400000000001,
        "english": "it.",
        "chinese": "它。"
    },
    {
        "start": 619.72,
        "end": 620.72,
        "english": "Hi there.",
        "chinese": "你好，大家。"
    },
    {
        "start": 620.72,
        "end": 623.2800000000001,
        "english": "Can I help you, folks?",
        "chinese": "英语：能帮我吗，朋友们？"
    },
    {
        "start": 623.2800000000001,
        "end": 626.24,
        "english": "I'm just browsing, seeing what's on the lot.",
        "chinese": "我正浏览，看看这个货。"
    },
    {
        "start": 626.24,
        "end": 627.96,
        "english": "My daughter wants a car for her birthday.",
        "chinese": "我的女儿想要一辆车作为她的生日礼物。"
    },
    {
        "start": 627.96,
        "end": 628.96,
        "english": "You know how it is.",
        "chinese": "英语：你知道吗？"
    },
    {
        "start": 628.96,
        "end": 635.24,
        "english": "Dad, I'm 16 already, and I'm like the only one at school who doesn't have a car.",
        "chinese": "爸爸，我今年16岁了，和学校里唯一一个不会开车的男生一样。"
    },
    {
        "start": 635.24,
        "end": 636.28,
        "english": "She's right, you know.",
        "chinese": "她没错，你知道。"
    },
    {
        "start": 636.28,
        "end": 638.08,
        "english": "Kids, these days, all have cars.",
        "chinese": "孩子们，这些天，所有的人都有车了。"
    },
    {
        "start": 638.08,
        "end": 639.5600000000001,
        "english": "Let me show you something we just got in.",
        "chinese": "我给你展示一下我们刚刚收到的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 639.5600000000001,
        "end": 642.76,
        "english": "A 1996 sedan, excellent gas mileage.",
        "chinese": "一辆1996年的轿车，性能良好。"
    },
    {
        "start": 642.76,
        "end": 646.8,
        "english": "It has dual airbags and anti-lac brakes, a perfect vehicle for a young driver.",
        "chinese": "英语：它有双气囊和防侧滑制动系统，是一款非常适合年轻驾驶的车辆。"
    },
    {
        "start": 646.8,
        "end": 648.28,
        "english": "Dad, I love it.",
        "chinese": "爸爸，我喜欢它。"
    },
    {
        "start": 648.28,
        "end": 649.28,
        "english": "It's awesome.",
        "chinese": "很好。"
    },
    {
        "start": 649.28,
        "end": 652.2,
        "english": "Can we get this one, please?",
        "chinese": "是的，可以，请问您需要我做什么？"
    },
    {
        "start": 652.2,
        "end": 653.52,
        "english": "I see.",
        "chinese": "我看到。"
    },
    {
        "start": 653.52,
        "end": 655.52,
        "english": "What can you tell me about this one?",
        "chinese": "对不起，我无法直接提供中文翻译。不过，我可以尝试用英语来回答这个问题。"
    },
    {
        "start": 655.88,
        "end": 660.48,
        "english": "Oh, that's just an old World War II tank that we use for TV commercials.",
        "chinese": "英语：哦，那只是我们用来做电视广告的旧世界大战坦克。"
    },
    {
        "start": 660.48,
        "end": 661.48,
        "english": "Now about this sedan.",
        "chinese": "现在关于这辆轿车。"
    },
    {
        "start": 661.48,
        "end": 663.28,
        "english": "Whoa, whoa, wait a minute.",
        "chinese": "英语：哇，哇，等一下。"
    },
    {
        "start": 663.28,
        "end": 665.52,
        "english": "Tell me more about this tank.",
        "chinese": "请告诉我关于这个坦克的更多信息。"
    },
    {
        "start": 666.52,
        "end": 671.16,
        "english": "Well, sir, if you are looking for quality and safety, then look no further.",
        "chinese": "英语：嗯，先生，如果你想要质量和安全的话，那就再看看其他选项吧。"
    },
    {
        "start": 671.16,
        "end": 676.1999999999999,
        "english": "Three inches of reinforced steel, protect your daughter from short-range missile attacks.",
        "chinese": "三寸长的高强度钢，保护你的女儿免受短距离导弹攻击。"
    },
    {
        "start": 676.1999999999999,
        "end": 679.52,
        "english": "Does the sedan protector from missile attacks?",
        "chinese": "英语：它从导弹攻击中保护的车灯。"
    },
    {
        "start": 679.52,
        "end": 680.84,
        "english": "It does not.",
        "chinese": "它不。"
    },
    {
        "start": 680.84,
        "end": 682.16,
        "english": "Well, I don't know.",
        "chinese": "我也不清楚。"
    },
    {
        "start": 682.16,
        "end": 683.4,
        "english": "Let me sleep on it.",
        "chinese": "好的，我明白了。请将需要翻译的英文内容提供给我，我会尽力准确地将其翻译成简化中文。"
    },
    {
        "start": 683.4,
        "end": 685.48,
        "english": "Did I mention the tank is a tank?",
        "chinese": "英语：Did I mention the tank is a tank?"
    },
    {
        "start": 685.48,
        "end": 686.48,
        "english": "I'll take it.",
        "chinese": "我将接手。"
    },
    {
        "start": 686.48,
        "end": 687.48,
        "english": "Dad.",
        "chinese": "爸爸。"
    },
    {
        "start": 693.96,
        "end": 696.5600000000001,
        "english": "So Marco, have you ever driven a tank?",
        "chinese": "英语：所以马科，你有没有开过坦克？"
    },
    {
        "start": 696.5600000000001,
        "end": 700.12,
        "english": "I mean, I know you're in the army, so.",
        "chinese": "我意思是，我知道你正在服役，所以。"
    },
    {
        "start": 700.12,
        "end": 701.12,
        "english": "Yeah.",
        "chinese": "是。"
    },
    {
        "start": 701.12,
        "end": 703.52,
        "english": "Yeah, actually, I did.",
        "chinese": "是的，实际上，我做了。"
    },
    {
        "start": 703.52,
        "end": 705.5600000000001,
        "english": "I did drive a tank before.",
        "chinese": "我之前开过坦克。"
    },
    {
        "start": 705.5600000000001,
        "end": 706.5600000000001,
        "english": "Really?",
        "chinese": "真的？"
    },
    {
        "start": 706.5600000000001,
        "end": 707.5600000000001,
        "english": "Yeah, really old one.",
        "chinese": "是的，它真的很老。"
    },
    {
        "start": 707.5600000000001,
        "end": 709.6,
        "english": "Kind of like a World War II type tank.",
        "chinese": "有点像二战时期的坦克。"
    },
    {
        "start": 709.6,
        "end": 711.4,
        "english": "But yeah, they're really fun and interesting.",
        "chinese": "但是啊，他们真的很有趣和好玩。"
    },
    {
        "start": 711.4,
        "end": 712.96,
        "english": "It's not like driving a normal car.",
        "chinese": "英语：它不像开普通汽车那样。"
    },
    {
        "start": 712.96,
        "end": 714.04,
        "english": "You have pedals and you have.",
        "chinese": "你有脚踏板，也有。"
    },
    {
        "start": 714.04,
        "end": 715.3199999999999,
        "english": "So there's no steering wheel?",
        "chinese": "英语：所以没有方向盘？"
    },
    {
        "start": 715.3199999999999,
        "end": 716.3199999999999,
        "english": "No, no, no.",
        "chinese": "英语：No, no, no."
    },
    {
        "start": 716.3199999999999,
        "end": 717.56,
        "english": "You have levers.",
        "chinese": "你有扳手。"
    },
    {
        "start": 717.56,
        "end": 718.56,
        "english": "Yeah.",
        "chinese": "是。"
    },
    {
        "start": 718.56,
        "end": 723.52,
        "english": "And what many people don't know is that actually tanks are manual transmissions.",
        "chinese": "很多人不知道实际上坦克是手动变速器。"
    },
    {
        "start": 723.52,
        "end": 724.76,
        "english": "You have to change gears.",
        "chinese": "你必须换挡。"
    },
    {
        "start": 724.76,
        "end": 725.76,
        "english": "Oh, really?",
        "chinese": "英语：哦，真的？"
    },
    {
        "start": 725.76,
        "end": 728.3199999999999,
        "english": "And it's really hard to change gears on those things.",
        "chinese": "A、它确实很难改变换挡杆的位置。"
    },
    {
        "start": 728.3199999999999,
        "end": 730.9599999999999,
        "english": "And what's the gas mileage like in a tank?",
        "chinese": "A、什么在罐子里的油耗是多少？"
    },
    {
        "start": 730.9599999999999,
        "end": 731.9599999999999,
        "english": "I don't know.",
        "chinese": "我不会。"
    },
    {
        "start": 731.9599999999999,
        "end": 733.56,
        "english": "Maybe like five miles per gallon.",
        "chinese": "英语：也许能跑五英里/小时。"
    },
    {
        "start": 733.56,
        "end": 734.56,
        "english": "Okay.",
        "chinese": "好的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 734.56,
        "end": 737.0799999999999,
        "english": "They run on diesel, which is a different type of fuel, right?",
        "chinese": "他们使用柴油，这是一种不同的燃料吗？"
    },
    {
        "start": 737.0799999999999,
        "end": 738.0799999999999,
        "english": "Yeah.",
        "chinese": "是。"
    },
    {
        "start": 738.0799999999999,
        "end": 739.0799999999999,
        "english": "Okay, well, very cool.",
        "chinese": "好的，很好。超级酷。"
    },
    {
        "start": 739.0799999999999,
        "end": 742.3199999999999,
        "english": "I never knew that my podcast partner had driven a tank.",
        "chinese": "我从没知道我的播客搭档开过坦克。"
    },
    {
        "start": 742.3199999999999,
        "end": 743.3199999999999,
        "english": "That's pretty awesome.",
        "chinese": "那真是太棒了。"
    },
    {
        "start": 743.32,
        "end": 745.24,
        "english": "Well, it was fun, definitely.",
        "chinese": "英语：很好，确实很有趣。"
    },
    {
        "start": 745.24,
        "end": 747.32,
        "english": "And I hope I get to do it again someday.",
        "chinese": "我希望能有一天再次做得到。"
    },
    {
        "start": 747.32,
        "end": 748.32,
        "english": "All right.",
        "chinese": "好的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 748.32,
        "end": 752.08,
        "english": "Well, guys, have you ever driven a tank?",
        "chinese": "是的，兄弟们，你们有没有开过坦克？"
    },
    {
        "start": 752.08,
        "end": 755.6400000000001,
        "english": "Or a submarine or any type of armored vehicle?",
        "chinese": "英语：或者潜艇或其他类型的装甲车辆。"
    },
    {
        "start": 755.6400000000001,
        "end": 759.84,
        "english": "Yeah, tell us about it at our website, EnglishPod.com.",
        "chinese": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我需要翻译的英文内容。"
    },
    {
        "start": 759.84,
        "end": 760.84,
        "english": "Right.",
        "chinese": "正确。以下是“right”在中文中的翻译："
    },
    {
        "start": 760.84,
        "end": 762.12,
        "english": "We'll be there to answer all your questions.",
        "chinese": "我们都会为你解答所有问题。"
    },
    {
        "start": 762.12,
        "end": 765.32,
        "english": "I'll also be there to maybe post some more crazy stories.",
        "chinese": "我也会去帮忙，说不定能分享一些有趣的新闻。"
    },
    {
        "start": 765.32,
        "end": 766.5200000000001,
        "english": "Or some pictures of a tank.",
        "chinese": "英语：或者一些坦克的照片。"
    },
    {
        "start": 766.5200000000001,
        "end": 767.5200000000001,
        "english": "Yeah, maybe.",
        "chinese": "是的，也许。"
    },
    {
        "start": 767.5200000000001,
        "end": 768.36,
        "english": "All right, guys.",
        "chinese": "英语：一切好，朋友们。"
    },
    {
        "start": 768.36,
        "end": 769.36,
        "english": "We'll see you there.",
        "chinese": "我们会在那里见你。"
    },
    {
        "start": 769.36,
        "end": 770.36,
        "english": "Until then, it's goodbye.",
        "chinese": "直到那时，就别客气了。"
    },
    {
        "start": 770.36,
        "end": 771.36,
        "english": "Bye.",
        "chinese": "再见。"
    }
]